{"title":"하프 오브 미","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=LFNR7/hAd4YfpEyT/YnqWSHSr5l6hAsKSTN7LF0&filename=th3","synopsis":"오전 7시부터 오후 7시, 12시간을 다른 사람 몸으로 살아야 한다…?!\n\n교통사고로 고등학생인 택인과 영혼이 바뀌게 된 희찬. 덕분에 인생을 바친 채소 사업이 망할 위기에 처했다! 희찬은 몸을 되찾기 위해 택인의 고등학교로 향하고…\n\n‘저 체육선생, 쟤가 왜 여기에…?’\n\n그 곳에서 고등학교 동창이었던 ‘개부처’를 만나게 된다. 반가운 마음에 희찬은 도움을 청하려 하지만… ‘김택인. 엎드려’\n\n이, 이게 아닌데…?! 험난하기만 한 여정, 과연 희찬은 원래 몸을 되찾을 수 있을까?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":279,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":256,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":233,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":285,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":203,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":205,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":241,"change":{"type":"down","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":209,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":151,"change":{"type":"up","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":246,"change":{"type":"down","amount":95}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":263,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":288,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":219,"change":{"type":"up","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-10-18","rank":216,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-10-19","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-10-22","rank":121,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-23","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":58}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":240,"c